      "quote": "source:\n  - name: NICEATM CoMPAIT Consortium\n    url: https://ntp.niehs.nih.gov/go/iccvam\n    citation: Kleinstreuer et al. (2018) Comp Tox; Strickland et al. (2023); Karmaus et al. (2022)\n    license: CC BY 4.0",
      "confidence": "medium"
    },
