      "quote": "NICEATM CoMPAIT Consortium URL: https://ntp.niehs.nih.gov/go/iccvam ... License: CC BY 4.0",
      "confidence": "medium"
    }
  ],
  "biobricks:reviewed": false,
  "biobricks:reviewNotes": "Determined by BioBricks licensing-provenance annotation agent. The brick's own README and meta.yaml both state the NICEATM CoMPAIT source data is CC BY 4.0. CoMPAIT is a NICEATM/NTP (NIH/NIEHS) collaborative modeling challenge dataset; the CC BY 4.0 designation is asserted by the brick metadata rather than verified on an authoritative NICEATM license page (I could not locate a standalone license statement on the ntp.niehs.nih.gov CoMPAIT landing page via web search). Class=attribution, commercial use permitted with attribution. Note the harmonized data aggregates sources including ECHA, ChemIDplus, DoD, EPA AEGL and NIOSH. HUMAN MUST VERIFY the CC BY 4.0 designation on the authoritative NICEATM/figshare release and confirm the aggregated component sources carry no more-restrictive terms.",
  "dcterms:creator": "NICEATM CoMPAIT Consortium (Kleinstreuer, Strickland, Karmaus, et al.)",
  "dcterms:publisher": "NICEATM / NTP, National Institute of Environmental Health Sciences (NIH)",
  "dcterms:bibliographicCitation": "Kleinstreuer et al. (2018) Comp Tox; Strickland et al. (2023); Karmaus et al. (2022)",
